OL,3,AIvan Toney denies Soho nightclub
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland striker Ivan Toney has pleaded
OL,7,Fnot guilty to assaulting a man at a
OL,8,Fcentral London nightclub.
OL,10,FThe 30-year-old footballer, from
OL,11,FNorthampton, is accused of headbutting
OL,12,Fand punching Saber Da Silva at a
OL,13,Fnightclub in Wardour Street, Soho, on 6
OL,14,FDecember.
OL,16,FAt Westminster Magistrates' Court,
OL,17,FToney confirmed his name and age, and
OL,18,Fpleaded not guilty to a charge of
OL,19,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
