OL,3,AIvan Toney denies Soho nightclub
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Briony Clarke said the
OL,7,Fcase could be tried in the magistrates
OL,8,Fcourt, but Toney elected for a Crown
OL,9,FCourt trial in front of a judge and
OL,10,Fjury.
